# Deploy files are read by systemd, Caddy and AppArmor on a Linux box. A CRLF
# checkout on Windows would ship CRs into config those parsers choke on, so
# pin them to LF regardless of anyone's core.autocrlf.
deploy/** text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# ...but never "normalize" binary assets: a CRLF→LF pass through an mp4 or a
# font strips real bytes and corrupts the file (it cost bg.mp4 31 bytes once).
*.mp4 binary
*.woff2 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
